  body: |
    # Benefit scope of the stated GB and Northern Ireland review arrangements

    ## Authored interpretation

    The source describes cross-border revision, supersession and appeal arrangements, then excludes named benefits including Pension Credit and UC from reviews or appeals under that agreement.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 070530–070533, including Memo 1/17, are read together. The general statement in 070530 is not applied universally. The agreement text, amendments and current jurisdiction remain unverified.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 070530, PDF page 98](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69ce3908bed91051df63a90e/dmg0701.pdf#page=98)
    - [DMG 070533, PDF page 98](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69ce3908bed91051df63a90e/dmg0701.pdf#page=98)

    ## Evidence and review status

    This is a model-assisted, unreviewed interpretation of selected passages in the frozen DWP source. It is an independent experimental publication, not an official DWP document, an entitlement decision or an executable rule. No specialist acceptance, current-law reconciliation or complete coverage of this chapter part is claimed. References to EU law, countries and benefits retain the scope and date context of the cited text; they do not establish applicability to a person or a later regime. Machine extraction may alter reading order and characters; no visual PDF review is claimed.

